/-! ## §3b. V2 certified close (H0, rev B: fake close type-impossible) -/

/-- **V2 certified posting-history close.** Strengthens
`PostingHistoryContinuumClose` per the rev B plan H0: the package must
PROVE the data's own provenance Props (a `True`-shell instantiation
still has to prove whatever Prop the data declared, and an honest data
declares the substantive generation/gauge statements), carry the
amplitude equality with the exact shell sum, and carry the decoy
escapes. This is the ONLY close shape a gap2 flip binding may cite. -/
structure PostingHistoryCertifiedCloseV2 where
  data : PostingHistoryContinuumData
  generated : data.generatedByActualPostingTransaction
  gaugeInvariant : data.historyGaugeInvariant
  bridge : PostingHistoryExactCharacterBridge data
  amplitude_matches : postingHistoryAmplitudeMatchesExactShell data bridge
  not_shellConstant : ¬ ShellConstant (tickDerivedPhase bridge.tau)
  not_eventuallyZero : ¬ EventuallyZeroPhase (tickDerivedPhase bridge.tau)
  tail : OscillatoryTail (tickDerivedPhase bridge.tau)

/-- **OPEN residual.** Nonempty V2 certified close. Deliberately
uninhabited here. -/
